  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 15.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="xno" source="#robertson" n="15.1" corresp="#wit-hk">E s'il ait auter fiede esté blasmé, s'en escundisse a treis duble, ceo est a saveir par XLII leals humes numez sei trente-siste main.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-hk">And if he has been previously accused, he shall clear himself with three times as many, namely with 35 compurgators found among 42 qualified men nominated [by the court].</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 260–261 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
